{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Jotun Queen</i> is a story-focused RPG with tactical turn based combat. The game is made by a single developer, but still aims to contain all you'd expect from a classic RPG, including</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical battles against enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience and level up your characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange things are happening around the northern border of the Morani Republic. Some say it is the sign that the end of the world is coming soon. Step into the role of Marius who, despite being a simple farmer, is not inclined to simply wait for the end. With the aid of his companions, perhaps you can find the true source of the disturbances. And maybe you'll learn a secret or two along the way...\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118290?t=1761278275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118290?t=1761278275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118290/adf2e51357fe9b75522e0c4b043daf742979c89a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761278275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118290/adf2e51357fe9b75522e0c4b043daf742979c89a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761278275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"descripti